6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I wonder if we have checked the network coverage at customer plants before promising delivery dates.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,I need to know which budget line this actually hits before we commit anything.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""George"",""self"":true,""raw"":""**George**: I need to know which budget line this actually hits before we commit anything.""}]}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I’m curious what happened to the last three internal rollouts.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Midori,,I’d like to see how much time we lose copying records that already exist somewhere else.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
