35,2,1,talk,Minato,,- **Minato**: The coordination group is just two people writing everything by hand.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"- **Jonathan**: The developers are tied up until the third quarter, and the interfaces are undocumented.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,George,,"- **George**: The capital line is frozen, but the software allowance still has room after those spring cancellations.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,- **May**: The last three rollouts show that anything needing daily entry from everyone was quietly dropped.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Midori,,"The incident logs show eleven misrouted deliveries, all because two units held different addresses for the same firm.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Midori"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Midori: The incident logs show eleven misrouted deliveries, all because two units held different addresses for the same firm.""}]}"
40,2,2,talk,Minato,,"- **Minato**: That means the same two people are doing all the work, which is very tiring for them.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,- **Jonathan**: That confirms my worry. We cannot promise dates when the groundwork is this fragile.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,George,,"- **George**: So the recurring allowance is our only real option, not the capital line.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,"- **May**: So we must avoid anything requiring constant daily input from everyone, or it will vanish.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Midori,,"- **Midori**: Those misrouted deliveries show the real cost of scattered records, not just the copying time.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Minato,,- **Minato**: I also found that two clerks keep asking for the same certificate from the same firm every year.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"- **Jonathan**: And half the customer plants lose signal for whole afternoons, making any mobile app unreliable.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,George,,"And four of six standardization efforts ended without an owner, so we must pick something with a clear, single steward.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""George"",""self"":true,""raw"":""George: And four of six standardization efforts ended without an owner, so we must pick something with a clear, single steward.""}]}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,"- **May**: And the narrow tools for one trade survived, so we should target a specific group, not everyone.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Midori,,"- **Midori**: So the real loss is the repeated work, not just the missing data.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Minato,,- **Minato**: I worry about who will absorb the extra work if we add more tasks for those two clerks.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,- **Jonathan**: Exactly. We cannot build on a foundation that is already crumbling under the weight of missing documentation.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,George,,"Agreed. We need a clear owner, or it will just become another abandoned project.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""George"",""self"":true,""raw"":""George: Agreed. We need a clear owner, or it will just become another abandoned project.""}]}"
53,2,4,talk,May,,- **May**: Agreed. We need a tool that survives without demanding daily effort from the whole company.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Midori,,So we need a solution that fixes the daily friction without adding to the burden of those already stretched thin.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Midori"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Midori: So we need a solution that fixes the daily friction without adding to the burden of those already stretched thin.""}]}"
